{"id": "section-body-27276", "title": "Attention Deficit / Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD)", "chapterId": "chapter-twenty-three", "blocks": [{"id": "body-27276", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Attention Deficit / Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD)", "runs": [{"text": "Attention"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Deficit"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "/"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Hyperactivity"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Disorder"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(ADHD)"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "359"}}, {"id": "body-27277", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "DSM-5 states that an individual diagnosed with attention-deficit and hyperactivity disorder would have difficulties in terms of functioning, mainly due to (a) inattention and/or (b) hyperactivity and impulsivity.", "runs": [{"text": "DSM-5 states that an individual diagnosed with attention-deficit and hyperactivity disorder would have difficulties in terms of functioning, mainly due to (a) inattention and/or (b) hyperactivity and impulsivity."}]}, {"id": "body-27279", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "The DSM-5 states that these inattentive and/or hyperactivity and impulsivity symptoms must be present before the age of 12 years old. In addition, these symptoms must have resulted in impaired functioning in at least 2 different social situations.", "runs": [{"text": "The DSM-5 states that these inattentive and/or hyperactivity and impulsivity symptoms must be present before the age of 12 years old. In addition, these symptoms must have resulted in impaired functioning in at least 2 different social situations."}]}, {"id": "body-27281", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-27282", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "The DSM-5 requires the individual to fulfill at least 6 of the following signs and symptoms of inat